{"html": "Set off on a delightful expedition and use your <b>photographic </b>eye to uncover the mysteries of the magical <b>TOEM </b>in this hand-drawn adventure game. Chat with quirky <b>characters</b>, solve their problems by snapping neat photos, and make your way through a relaxing landscape!\n<br>\n\n<br>\nTake photos with your <b>camera</b> to solve puzzles and help people!\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<video muted=\"\" preload=\"auto\" loop=\"\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" style=\"margin: auto;display:block;width:100%\">\n  <source src=\"https://items.gog.com/toem/mp4/toem_birds.gif.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<br>\n\n<br>\nListen to chill beats and take in your surroundings!\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<video muted=\"\" preload=\"auto\" loop=\"\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" style=\"margin: auto;display:block;width:100%\">\n  <source src=\"https://items.gog.com/toem/mp4/toem_beats.gif.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<br>\n\n<br>\nMeet quirky characters and help them with their problems!\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<video muted=\"\" preload=\"auto\" loop=\"\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" style=\"margin: auto;display:block;width:100%\">\n  <source src=\"https://items.gog.com/toem/mp4/toem_friends.gif.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<br>\n\n<br>\nFollow the Development On <a href=\"https://twitter.com/swmgames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Twitter!</a>\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<video muted=\"\" preload=\"auto\" loop=\"\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" style=\"margin: auto;display:block;width:100%\">\n  <source src=\"https://items.gog.com/toem/mp4/toem_WIP.gif.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<br>\n\n<br>\nJoin the TOEM <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/UwxJNqD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord!</a>\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://items.gog.com/toem/aboutBannerDiscord.png\">"}